{"id":12202,"date":"2024-08-01T19:29:50","date_gmt":"2024-08-01T19:29:50","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=12202"},"modified":"2024-08-01T19:32:00","modified_gmt":"2024-08-01T19:32:00","slug":"zub-casu-panenky-barbie-a-ft-ir-spektroskopie","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/zub-casu-panenky-barbie-a-ft-ir-spektroskopie\/","title":{"rendered":"Zub \u010dasu, panenky Barbie a FT-IR spektroskopie"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Od sv\u00e9ho debutu v roce 1959 se panenky Barbie od Mattela staly kulturn\u00edmi ikonami, odr\u00e1\u017eej\u00edc\u00edmi spole\u010densk\u00e9 trendy a historick\u00e9 momenty. Navzdory sv\u00e9 popularit\u011b \u010del\u00ed tyto plastov\u00e9 hra\u010dky v\u00fdrazn\u00e9mu zhor\u0161ov\u00e1n\u00ed kvality v pr\u016fb\u011bhu \u010dasu, co\u017e p\u0159edstavuje v\u00fdzvy nap\u0159\u00edklad pro sb\u011bratele a muzejn\u00ed konzerv\u00e1tory. Ned\u00e1vn\u00e1 studie italsk\u00fdch v\u00fdzkumn\u00edk\u016f zkoumala materi\u00e1lov\u00e9 slo\u017een\u00ed a procesy degradace panenek Barbie vyroben\u00fdch mezi lety 1959 a 1976.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.mdpi.com\/2073-4360\/14\/20\/4287\">V\u00fdzkum<\/a> pou\u017eil multi-analytick\u00fd p\u0159\u00edstup k anal\u00fdze 15 panenek Barbie. C\u00edlem bylo vyplnit informa\u010dn\u00ed mezeru ohledn\u011b zm\u011bn ve v\u00fdrobn\u00edch procesech Barbie a pochopit degrada\u010dn\u00ed jevy ovliv\u0148uj\u00edc\u00ed tyto hra\u010dky.<\/p>\n<p>P\u016fvodn\u011b byly panenky Barbie vyrobeny z plastifikovan\u00e9ho polyvinylchloridu (PVC). Migrace p\u0159\u00edsad, zejm\u00e9na zm\u011bk\u010dovadel, vedla k lepkav\u00e9mu a leskl\u00e9mu povlaku na povrchu panenek. Nov\u011bj\u0161\u00ed Barbie jsou vyrobeny ze stabiln\u011bj\u0161\u00edch polymer\u016f, ale degradace se st\u00e1le vyskytuje, i kdy\u017e pomaleji. V\u00fdzkumn\u00edci pou\u017eili multispektr\u00e1ln\u00ed fotografii ve viditeln\u00e9m a ultrafialov\u00e9m sv\u011btle, mikroskopick\u00e1 pozorov\u00e1n\u00ed a infra\u010dervenou spektroskopii s Fourierovou transformac\u00ed (FT-IR ATR) k anal\u00fdze materi\u00e1l\u016f a degrada\u010dn\u00edch produkt\u016f panenek.<\/p>\n<p><strong>FT-IR ATR<\/strong> (v tomto v\u00fdzkumu pomoc\u00ed FT-IR spektrometru <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/nicolet-summit\/\"><strong>Nicolet Summit<\/strong><\/a>) je metoda nedestruktivn\u00ed anal\u00fdzy povrch\u016f polymer\u016f, kter\u00e1 vyu\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 infra\u010derven\u00e9 z\u00e1\u0159en\u00ed interaguj\u00edc\u00ed s povrchem vzorku p\u0159es ATR krystal. V\u00fdsledn\u00e9 spektrum poskytuje podrobn\u00e9 informace o chemick\u00e9 struktu\u0159e a slo\u017een\u00ed polymeru bez po\u0161kozen\u00ed povrchu, co\u017e je zvl\u00e1\u0161t\u011b vhodn\u00e9 pro anal\u00fdzu cenn\u00fdch nebo citliv\u00fdch artefakt\u016f jako historick\u00e9 panenky Barbie.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_1395\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-1395\" style=\"width: 468px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-1395 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/49c3947d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"468\" height=\"405\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/49c3947d.jpg 468w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/49c3947d-300x260.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 468px) 100vw, 468px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-1395\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">FT-IR spektrometr <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/nicolet-summit\/\">Nicolet Summit<\/a><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>Studie odhalila v\u00fdznamn\u00e9 zm\u011bny v materi\u00e1lov\u00e9m slo\u017een\u00ed panenek Barbie v pr\u016fb\u011bhu let. Ran\u00e9 Barbie (1959-1960) byly p\u0159ev\u00e1\u017en\u011b vyrobeny z PVC, kter\u00e9 trp\u011blo migrac\u00ed p\u0159\u00edsad. V 70. letech se materi\u00e1ly zm\u011bnily na stabiln\u011bj\u0161\u00ed polymery jako ethylen-vinylacet\u00e1t (EVA) a akrylonitrilbutadienstyren (ABS). Tyto zm\u011bny byly zp\u016fsobeny technologick\u00fdm pokrokem a regula\u010dn\u00edmi tlaky, jako z\u00e1kony omezuj\u00edc\u00ed obsah zm\u011bk\u010dovadel v hra\u010dk\u00e1ch z bezpe\u010dnostn\u00edch d\u016fvod\u016f.<\/p>\n<p>V\u00fdzkum poskytl podrobn\u00e9 poznatky o degrada\u010dn\u00edch mechanismech panenek Barbie. Migrace zm\u011bk\u010dovadel na b\u00e1zi ftal\u00e1t\u016f z hmotn\u00e9ho polymeru na povrch byla identifikov\u00e1na jako hlavn\u00ed p\u0159\u00ed\u010dina zhor\u0161ov\u00e1n\u00ed kvality. Tato migrace vede k l\u00e1mavosti a tvorb\u011b lepkav\u00e9 patiny, zjistiteln\u00e9 pod viditeln\u00fdm a UV sv\u011btlem. Multi-analytick\u00fd p\u0159\u00edstup studie umo\u017enil identifikaci specifick\u00fdch degrada\u010dn\u00edch produkt\u016f a polymer\u016f, ze kter\u00fdch poch\u00e1zej\u00ed.<\/p>\n<p>V\u00fdsledky p\u0159in\u00e1\u0161ej\u00ed v\u00fdzvy v konzervaci plastov\u00fdch v\u00fdrobk\u016f, jeliko\u017e rychl\u00e1 degradace t\u011bchto v\u00fdrobk\u016f zd\u016fraz\u0148uje pot\u0159ebu inovativn\u00edch konzerva\u010dn\u00edch strategi\u00ed. Budouc\u00ed v\u00fdzkum se zam\u011b\u0159\u00ed na hlub\u0161\u00ed zkoum\u00e1n\u00ed polymern\u00edch frakc\u00ed, p\u0159\u00edsad a jejich degrada\u010dn\u00edch produkt\u016f s c\u00edlem vyvinout \u00fa\u010dinn\u00e9 metody konzervace k zabr\u00e1n\u011bn\u00ed dal\u0161\u00edho zhor\u0161ov\u00e1n\u00ed.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Od sv\u00e9ho debutu v roce 1959 se panenky Barbie od Mattela staly kulturn\u00edmi ikonami, odr\u00e1\u017eej\u00edc\u00edmi spole\u010densk\u00e9 trendy a historick\u00e9 momenty. Navzdory sv\u00e9 popularit\u011b \u010del\u00ed tyto plastov\u00e9 hra\u010dky v\u00fdrazn\u00e9mu zhor\u0161ov\u00e1n\u00ed kvality v pr\u016fb\u011bhu \u010dasu, co\u017e p\u0159edstavuje v\u00fdzvy nap\u0159\u00edklad pro sb\u011bratele a muzejn\u00ed konzerv\u00e1tory. Ned\u00e1v